id":"wanglou-e-693269838a41c6acc4d0","title":"卫将军滕牧、征西将军留平请免王蕃，不能得","accounts":[{"id":"wanglou-a-693269838a41c6acc4d0","label":"正文","text":"卫将军滕牧、征西将军留平请免王蕃，不能得","evidence":["wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0066","role":"请免","evidence":["wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0053","role":"请免","evidence":["wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71"]},{"person":"luxun-p0069","role":"被请","evidence":["wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71"]},"ordering_evidence":"wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71","order":11065}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0066","name":"滕牧","evidence":["santizhu-q-395f1ca8c852b7381216","santizhu-q-d25c4ed62248552a49e6","santizhu-q-e0cbdc2b9992edfc62f4","feipin-q-2fead510f96cdddb5730","feipin-q-1662d482394c678ce8b0","feipin-q-4a279511cc46b608b0d1","feipin-q-ad2d4213e4ff2d2a6b76","feipin-q-af8047ab02040a0f527f","wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-1662d482394c678ce8b0","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-dd96e7dd37b1c8b40940","layer":"original","quote":"牧见谴居苍梧郡，虽爵位不夺，其实（裔）〔谪〕也；遂道路忧死。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-2fead510f96cdddb5730","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-09aa26dfcc979122d530","layer":"original","quote":"后朝士以牧尊戚〖3〗，颇推令谏争。而夫人宠渐衰，皓滋不悦〖4〗；皓母何，恒左右之〖5〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-4a279511cc46b608b0d1","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-e1826f754b9123141685","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓滕夫人，故太常胤之族女也。胤夷灭，夫人父牧，以疏远徙边郡〖1〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-ad2d4213e4ff2d2a6b76","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-e1826f754b9123141685","layer":"original","quote":"孙休即位，大赦；得还，以牧为五官中郎〖2〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-af8047ab02040a0f527f","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-09aa26dfcc979122d530","layer":"original","quote":"封牧高密侯，拜卫将军，录尚书事。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-395f1ca8c852b7381216","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-2466c1de60d62b2735c4","layer":"original","quote":"封后父滕牧为高密侯；﹝二﹞舅何洪等三人，皆列侯","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-d25c4ed62248552a49e6","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-ce53f2e42f3b27e5176b","layer":"original","quote":"卫将军滕牧，留镇武昌","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e0cbdc2b9992edfc62f4","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4c77631a05446910df8b","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴历》曰：“牧本名密；避丁密，改名牧。丁密避牧，改名为固。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见引句）","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ba660c623bc8655fba3c","start":3,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-e774f8c8af898e42f886","layer":"original","quote":"卫将军滕牧、征西将军留平请〖15〗，不能得。﹝一﹞丞相陆凯上疏曰〖16〗：“常侍王蕃，黄中通理〖17〗，知天知物，处朝忠謇〖18〗。斯社稷之重镇，大吴之龙逢也〖19〗。昔事景皇〖20〗，纳言左右〖21〗；景皇钦嘉，叹为异伦〖22〗。而陛下忿其苦辞〖23〗，恶其直对；枭之殿堂，尸骸暴弃；（郡）〔邦〕内伤心，有识悲悼！”其痛蕃如此。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":165,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
